{"about_the_game":"The great demon lord fell in love with the human princess at first sight, but the evil prince kidnapped the lord\u2019s beloved. In order to save the princess, the lord embarked on an expedition, conquered the rat folk, the fish folk, the dragon, plundered the elves, and finally faced the rapidly developing human!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Lord's journey is a strategy-based large-army auto chess game, need to match the most suitable lineup and position, divided into story mode and endless mode. Players can obtain powerful cards in the story mode, and the number of consumptions will affect the direction of the story. Once you pass the first level of story mode, you will unlock the endless mode and subsequent story levels. In the endless mode, you can build a lineup as much as you want, but there is a failure penalty in the endless mode.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084490?t=1726313272","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084490?t=1726313272","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726313272","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726313272","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"The great demon lord fell in love with the human princess at first sight, but the evil prince kidnapped the lord\u2019s beloved. In order to save the princess, the lord embarked on an expedition, conquered the rat folk, the fish folk, the dragon, plundered the elves, and finally faced the rapidly developing human!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Lord's journey is a strategy-based large-army auto chess game, need to match the most suitable lineup and position, divided into story mode and endless mode. Players c